			</div>
			<div class="content" id="post-content-2065913">
									

<p>I was planning an epilogue that lampshades that but decided against it. The narrator calls them &quot;the pinky of Fifthism&quot;. They more or less clean up after themselves, so the Foundation sends an agent to document these things before the next instance appears.</p>
<p>The fact that it played on the radio I felt went in hand with the whole &quot;calls to you&quot; overarching theme of the thing. In the end people completely uninvolved with the events of the story <em>happened</em> to tune in at the wrong time, and now they're dead.</p>

